    "post_id": "3ms4shrsxck2s",
    "text": "Much of Te Ika-a-M\u0101ui is chillier than Te Waipounamu this morning, with Galatea (Bay of Plenty) shivering at -3.3\u00b0C while Timaru sweats at 15\u00b0C \ud83d\udd00\n\nWesterly winds whipping up warmth in the south turn strong southerly during today, bringing back the brrrrr in tomorrow's brisk minimum temperatures \u2603\ufe0f",
